==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|i}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|kiit|tää}}
* Rhymes: [[liittää]], [[niittää]], [[riittää]], [[siittää]]
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈkiːtːæː(ʔ)]}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}
{{context|transitive|lang=fi}}

# To [[thank]] sb (= ''partitive'') for sth (= ''elative''), [[express]] one's [[gratitude]].
#: '''''Kiitin''' [[hän]]tä [[ilta|illasta]].''
#:: ''I '''thanked''' her for the evening.''
#: '''''[[en#Finnish|En]] [[voida|voi]] kiittää''' [[sinä|sinua]] '''[[kylliksi]]'''.''
#:: ''I '''don't know how to express''' my '''gratitude''' (to you).'' (literally: ''I can't '''thank''' you enough.'')
#: ''Ei '''kiittämistä'''!'' (fourth infinitive in partitive)
#:: ''Don’t mention it!''
# To [[praise]], [[commend]].
# {{context|figuratively|lang=fi}} To [[lay at the feet of]] (to assign responsibility for something to someone).
#: ''Kuinka pitkälti saamme '''kiittää''' Iowan esivaaleja nykyisestä maatalouspolitiikastamme?''
#:: How much of our current agricultural policy can we '''lay at the feet of''' the Iowa caucuses?

